# Icarus AirSim-only SITL overrides.
# Offscreen Blocks v1.8.0 cannot sustain ArduCopter's 300 Hz default loop on
# the target developer GPU. 150 Hz remains above AirSim's 100 Hz physics rate
# and prevents a timing-only pre-arm failure without disabling safety checks.
SCHED_LOOP_RATE 150
# Blocks v1.8.0 publishes valid HIL position/velocity but its GPS health flag is
# not accepted by current ArduPilot. Skip only the GPS-lock pre-arm bit (1<<3);
# all mandatory checks and every other non-mandatory check remain enabled.
ARMING_SKIPCHK 8
